  "description": "Fitness Class Waiver records class format, instructor, equipment, exertion condition, participant choice, and session completion. Fitness Class Waiver evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this fitness class waiver risk acknowledgment when staff must document class format and instructor. Reconcile equipment, exertion condition, participant choice, and session completion before the fitness class waiver handoff. Use the class description, instructor credential reference, equipment list, disclosed exertion conditions, modification menu, participant questions, and attendance result. This acknowledgment concerns an instructor-led exercise session with cardio or resistance intensity, repetitions, studio equipment, modification choices, rest, and class completion. Ask the assigned fitness class waiver reviewer to confirm class format against the organization's policy.",
